              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-l\u0022\u003ESection breaks\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESection breaks are used to create a thematic break between sections of content. DO NOT use a section break for purely aesthetic reasons.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are 4 different sizes of section breaks. The sizes represent the amount of margin surrounding the grey line allocated to the section break.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 class=\u0022govuk-heading-s\u0022\u003ESmall\u003C/h3\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
